    "updated_at": "2025-03-29T00:27:36Z",
    "body": "A related [TAG review](https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/1000#issuecomment-2433471327) also said as to \"why `<link>` or `@import` cannot be used for sharing styles across shadow roots\", \"perhaps the issue can be addressed at the root, by specifying that these requests MUST be deduplicated, either by default (if web compatible) or with a certain flag set\". \n\nEven with a proposed [link reference to an inline `<style>` element](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11019) for [`@sheet`](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11509) as a possible workaround, this still needs to be fixed.",
